  "summary": "Bind synthetic partial shipments, measured validation gains and corrected Core status.",
  "why": "Luis approved Pareto test performance, backlog reconciliation and the Shop TDD exercise. RED 5d564fa requires the fixture runner; 4aac817 guards a mislabeled mapping. GREEN 9078870 runs the existing Shop then one synthetic two-unit order and two independently tracked shipments through public revision/population/admission/replay. The original prefix and all prior records survive; unknown type, dangling endpoint and stale preparation refuse without the forbidden writes. Five focused tests and the full 248-test Shop selection pass. The report records 71 events, eight changes, two revisions, exact source/report/history identities and no runtime change. Earlier complete governance selection: 365 passed. Final Git compatibility RED b01eebb and GREEN 9925ed3 preserve annotated-object peeling; six focused guards pass. Scoped Ruff/format/diff and local links pass. Backlog and status distinguish current bounded results from formal pending work. No fixture truth, fulfilment policy, activity migration, external effect, Re-entry integration, dependency/package change or push is claimed. Final governance/docs validation follows this rebind.",
